I dedicate this project & repository to my Lord and savior Jesus Christ.

By his blood shed for me on the cross, I am cleansed and righteous.

By the wounds inflicted on his body, I am set free and called his son.

By his death, the man I used to be has been buried.

By his resurrection, I am raised to new life by the power of the Holy Spirit.

All the good things in my life, and any good that has, or ever will come from my life, I owe it all to Jesus Christ.

May all the glory go to God, and my Lord Jesus Christ. Forever and ever. Amen.
